{4}\\,\\text{cm}.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186556366 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3b8b15ed-493d-56f0-91b4-96c0546ae3a2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7\\,\\text{mm}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556362} {:answer/id #uuid "8a3aafe4-37fc-512f-9335-c0b5740cbecb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{6}{7}\\,\\text{mm}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556375} {:answer/id #uuid "c2121115-e08d-5100-ac2e-6cef9261566c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\,\\text{mm}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556393} {:answer/id #uuid "e19dcdf1-d006-5161-a5fd-af6492cf1462" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\,\\text{mm}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556398} {:answer/id #uuid "e9c66126-e596-580e-91de-79431398b6de" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "294\\,\\text{mm}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556402}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e19dcdf1-d006-5161-a5fd-af6492cf1462" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\,\\text{mm}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556398} :answer-field/id #uuid "ba9f84d4-40bc-5670-b78b-e2d89edb52b5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556390}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "56e458c0-2e91-5258-b0ff-cd258f195c67" :question/problem "![](images/69/6949b198287b58d95ba47662a3432760d7e5a98d60bd006541269abcc9f3e2ab.png)\n\nThe area of the triangle $△ABC$ is $\\frac{21}{2}\\,\\text{mm}^{2}.$ Use $\\sin30^{\\circ}=\\frac{1}{2}.$ Find $AC.$" :question/worked-solution "The formula for the area of the triangle is \n\n$$\nA=\\frac{1}{2}bc\\operatorname{sin}⁡A,\n$$\n\nwhere $∠A$ is between the sides of lengths $b$ and $c.$ \n\nHere\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c & =AB=7\\text{ mm} \\\\ b & =AC \\\\ m∠A & ={30}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘}=\\frac{1}{2},\n$$\n\nwe can calculate $b=AC,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot b\\cdot c\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡A \\\\ \\frac{21}{2} & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot b\\cdot 7\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘} \\\\ \\frac{21}{2} & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot b\\cdot 7\\cdot (\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\ \\frac{21}{2} & =\\frac{7}{4}b \\\\ b & =\\frac{\\frac{21}{2}}{\\frac{7}{4}} \\\\ b & =6\\text{ mm}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe conclude that $AC=6\\,\\text{mm}.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186556379 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fb0dc146-0b8f-5788-b4d6-1d2af2fc1489" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556404}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fb0dc146-0b8f-5788-b4d6-1d2af2fc1489" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556404} :answer-field/id #uuid "9ea43d3b-18e5-535a-9041-c2927666f8ca" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556383}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "93b23a78-a854-5cfb-a02e-a33896d85d60" :question/problem "![](images/52/52e6b64e78550f0e1cfeecc59a606921b52af85c457fff5e936f45a0a732c243.png)\n\nThe area of the triangle $△ABC$ is $1\\,\\text{cm}^{2}.$ Use $\\sin30^{\\circ}=\\frac{1}{2}.$ Then, $AC=${{field-1}} $\\text{cm}.$" :question/worked-solution "The formula for the area of the triangle is \n\n$$\nA=\\frac{1}{2}bc\\operatorname{sin}⁡A,\n$$\n\nwhere $∠A$ is between the sides of lengths $b$ and $c.$ \n\nHere\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c & =AB=2\\text{ cm} \\\\ b & =AC \\\\ m∠A & ={30}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘}=\\frac{1}{2},\n$$\n\nwe can calculate $b=AC,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot b\\cdot c\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡A \\\\ 1 & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot b\\cdot 2\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘} \\\\ 1 & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot b\\cdot 2\\cdot (\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\ 1 & =\\frac{1}{2}b \\\\ b & =\\frac{1}{\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\ b & =2\\text{ cm}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe conclude that $AC=2\\,\\text{cm}.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186556381 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0d6f5fef-1f26-5927-9aba-3e07ba091909" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "588\\,\\text{mm}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556355} {:answer/id #uuid "1ddcbedc-9b6d-572c-a3ed-af91585959a8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7\\,\\text{mm}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556358} {:answer/id #uuid "9ea08d46-2b55-577e-86f2-f830a33e8ccc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\,\\text{mm}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556382} {:answer/id #uuid "a5562289-9847-5a37-82e2-0f14fe73c7e7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{12}{7}\\,\\text{mm}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556385} {:answer/id #uuid "ba510cf0-a3a0-5d06-8f32-bab53002d3b3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12\\,\\text{mm}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556389}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ba510cf0-a3a0-5d06-8f32-bab53002d3b3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12\\,\\text{mm}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556389} :answer-field/id #uuid "b0ba1fed-347d-5277-b120-1a48f185cceb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556386}] :q