\n$$\nx(4)=- \\frac{5 (4)^{2}}{4} - \\frac{4 (4)}{3} - 6=(-6)+(-20)+(- \\frac{16}{3})=- \\frac{94}{3}.\n$$\n\nThen the table is\n\n| **$t$** | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ | $4$ | $5$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $-6$ | $- \\frac{103}{12}$ | $- \\frac{41}{3}$ | $- \\frac{85}{4}$ | $- \\frac{94}{3}$ | $- \\frac{527}{12}$ |\n| $y$ | $6$ | $\\frac{59}{12}$ | $\\frac{7}{3}$ | $- \\frac{7}{4}$ | $- \\frac{22}{3}$ | $- \\frac{173}{12}$ |"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557631 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9bd1951c-0602-55a5-8645-0789fe856a88" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{25}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557671}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9bd1951c-0602-55a5-8645-0789fe856a88" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{25}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557671} :answer-field/id #uuid "55ebcdaa-54ae-5f9c-bb83-2fab47dcd1f6" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557651} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "591b377a-f05f-55a2-80e5-1390a0863f4f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{56}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557654}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "591b377a-f05f-55a2-80e5-1390a0863f4f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{56}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557654} :answer-field/id #uuid "656eda5e-1958-5e69-9543-aece5e8c6dcf" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557656} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "08441e59-4936-522c-94dc-e808225422f2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{9}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 1